# Source of truth: `.agents`

Keep `.cursor` empty of project conventions. Canonical agent files:

- Rules: `.agents/rules/*.mdc`
- Skills: `.agents/skills/`

Read and follow those files. Honor each rule’s `globs` and `description`. Use a skill when the task matches its `description`. Never copy rules or skills into `.cursor`.
